{%- if page.path == 'index.html' %}
<section class="company-home" aria-labelledby="company-title">
  <section class="company-hero">
    <div class="company-hero-copy">
      <p class="company-kicker"><span aria-hidden="true"></span> 企业数据与 AI 落地</p>
      <h1 id="company-title">让 AI 进入<br><em>真实业务流程</em></h1>
      <p class="company-lead">把分散的数据、文档和重复工作接进现有系统。从一个业务卡点开始，用小范围试点验证质量、效率和成本。</p>
      <div class="company-actions">
        <a class="company-button primary" href="/about/">沟通业务需求 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a class="company-button secondary" href="/cases/#invoice-demo">体验场景演示 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <figure class="company-workbench" aria-labelledby="workflow-title">
      <div class="workbench-bar">
        <span class="workbench-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
        <span>流程示意</span>
      </div>
      <figcaption id="workflow-title">售后咨询如何流转</figcaption>
      <ol class="workbench-flow">
        <li><span class="flow-number">01</span><div><strong>读懂问题</strong><small>识别产品、故障与诉求</small></div></li>
        <li><span class="flow-number">02</span><div><strong>从知识库查答案</strong><small>按权限检索，附上来源</small></div></li>
        <li><span class="flow-number">03</span><div><strong>复杂问题转人工</strong><small>把上下文和待核实项带入工单</small></div></li>
      </ol>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="company-section" aria-labelledby="solutions-title">
    <div class="company-section-head">
      <div><p class="company-kicker">解决方案</p><h2 id="solutions-title">从业务卡点入手</h2></div>
      <a class="company-text-link" href="/services/">查看全部服务 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="company-cards">
      <a class="company-card" href="/services/#data-knowledge">
        <span class="company-card-index" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
        <h3>数据与知识</h3>
        <p>统一指标口径、治理数据质量，让企业资料可搜索、可引用、可更新。</p>
        <span class="company-card-note">数据治理 · 企业知识库 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
      </a>
      <a class="company-card" href="/services/#business-operations">
        <span class="company-card-index" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
        <h3>业务流程自动化</h3>
        <p>让票据、订单和客服工单按规则流转，把需要判断的异常交给业务人员。</p>
        <span class="company-card-note">智能单据 · 客服与售后 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
      </a>
      <a class="company-card" href="/services/#engineering">
        <span class="company-card-index" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
        <h3>数据开发与 Agent</h3>
        <p>辅助找表、写 SQL 和测试，把 AI 接入实际使用的工具、审批和交付流程。</p>
        <span class="company-card-note">AI 数据开发 · 企业 Agent <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="company-demo-feature" aria-labelledby="demo-feature-title">
    <div>
      <p class="company-kicker">场景演示 · 模拟数据</p>
      <h2 id="demo-feature-title">一张单据如何进入复核队列</h2>
      <p>切换三种模拟样本，看看订单号缺失或金额不符时，规则如何给出可追溯的复核理由。</p>
      <a class="company-text-link" href="/cases/#invoice-demo">打开单据校验演示 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
    <dl class="feature-receipt" aria-label="金额不符的模拟单据">
      <div><dt>订单编号</dt><dd>PO-DEMO-02</dd></div>
      <div><dt>订单金额</dt><dd>¥1,080.00</dd></div>
      <div><dt>单据金额</dt><dd>¥1,180.00</dd></div>
      <div><dt>处理结果</dt><dd><span class="company-status review">金额不符 · 待复核</span></dd></div>
    </dl>
  </section>

  <section class="company-section" aria-labelledby="delivery-title">
    <div class="company-section-head">
      <div><p class="company-kicker">交付方式</p><h2 id="delivery-title">先试一个流程，再决定是否扩大</h2></div>
    </div>
    <ol class="company-steps">
      <li><strong>需求诊断</strong><p>梳理操作步骤、业务量和当前成本，确定一项试点任务。</p></li>
      <li><strong>场景演示</strong><p>用模拟或公开数据跑通输入、结果与异常流转。</p></li>
      <li><strong>小范围试点</strong><p>约定交付边界，测量准确率、复核耗时和运行成本。</p></li>
      <li><strong>实施与交接</strong><p>根据试点结果确定集成方案、权限和日常维护方式。</p></li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="company-contact-band" aria-labelledby="home-contact-title">
    <div><h2 id="home-contact-title">有一项工作反复占用团队时间？</h2><p>说说现在谁在做、每次耗时多久，以及最常卡在哪一步。</p></div>
    <a class="company-button light" href="/about/">联系智定行 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </section>
</section>
{%- endif %}
